ed to the law of righteousness.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse ¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙWherefore? Because they sought it not by faith, but as it were by the works of the law. For they stumbled at that stumblingstone;¦layout ªlast_verse „¥verse!¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines“‚¤text±as it is written,¦layout ‚¤textÙ;Behold, I lay in Sion a stumblingstone and rock of offence:¦layout§quote_1‚¤textÙ4And whosoever believeth on him shall not be ashamed.¦layout§quote_1ªlast_verse!